# inc-b0ziu.2: summon one human beside the player, then run the wizard command
# "Wake Every Creature". Oracle: the WAKE_PROBE line in the run's errors.log
# (INCURSION_WAKE_PROBE=1 first puts every creature to sleep).
# Run by tools/check_wake_all.sh against a loaded character.
w y
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Humans"
@choose "human"
RIGHT ENTER
@dump:summoned
w
@choose "Wake Every Creature"
@dump:woken
SPACE*20
ESC*20

s

@quit
